  {id:'m12',nome:'RentCar Madeira - Hotel',cat:'Rent-Car',empresa:'Rent Car Madeira',subjectEN:'Your Car Rental Confirmation – Rent Car Madeira',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nThank you so much for your booking — it’s now fully confirmed! \n\nPlease find below your reservation details:\n\n⸻\n\n🚙 Rental Company: Rent-a-Car Madeira\n Direct Contact:  +351 936 716 627 (also on WhatsApp)\n Payment: At pick-up (cash or card – whichever is most convenient)\n\n Pick-up at your accommodation:\nThe rent-a-car company will be waiting for you at your accomodation at the agreed time to deliver the car, so please make sure to be ready at that time.\n\n🪪 Documents required:\n– Passport or ID card\n– Driving licence\n(That’s all you’ll need!)\n\nAdditional important note:\nAll vehicles',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
