  {id:'m14',nome:'RentCar Madeira -  Office (impossível alojamento)',cat:'Rent-Car',empresa:'Rent Car Madeira',subjectEN:'Your Car Rental Confirmation – Rent Car Madeira',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nThank you so much for your booking — it’s now fully confirmed! \n\nPlease find below your reservation details:\n\n⸻\n\n🚙 Rental Company: Rent-a-Car Madeira\n Direct Contact: +351 936 716 627 (also on WhatsApp)\n Payment: At pick-up (cash or card — whichever is most convenient)\n\n Pick-up point (office):\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/9YLmyqyP12jhXbHPA\n\n⚠️ Important note:\nDue to a very high number of requests on your date, the car will need to be collected directly at the office.\nUnfortunately, delivery to accommodation is not possible on this day.\n\n🪪 Documents required at pick-up:\n– Passport or ID',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
