  {id:'m16',nome:'Ab4 - Aeroporto',cat:'Rent-Car',empresa:'Ab4 Rent',subjectEN:'Your Car Rental Confirmation – Ab4 Rent',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nThank you so much for your booking — it’s now fully confirmed!\n\nPlease find below your reservation details:\n\n⸻\n\n🚙 Rental Company: AB4RENT\n Payment: At pick-up (cash or card – whichever is most convenient)\n\n Pick-up at Madeira Airport (if applicable):\n– The company already has your flight number.\n– A representative will meet you outside the arrivals area (on the street).\n– Once you land, they will usually contact you by phone.\n\n⚠️ Important:\nIf you don’t see anyone immediately after leaving the arrivals area, please call +351 961 932 738 to let them know you’ve arrived.\nSometimes airp',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m17',nome:'Ab4 - Hotel',cat:'Rent-Car',empresa:'Ab4 Rent',subjectEN:'Your Car Rental Confirmation – Ab4 Rent',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nThank you so much for your booking — it’s now fully confirmed! \n\nPlease find below your reservation details:\n\n⸻\n\n🚙 Rental Company: AB4RENT\n Direct Contact: +351 961 932 738\n Payment: At delivery (cash or card – whichever is most convenient)\n\n Car Delivery at Your Accommodation:\n– The rent-a-car company will deliver the car directly to your accommodation.\n– Please make sure to be ready at the agreed time, as the representative will meet you at the entrance/reception.\n– They will also usually contact you by phone once they are nearby.\n\n🪪 Documents required:\n– Passport or ID card\n– Dr',subjectPT:'A sua confirmação de aluguer de automóvel – Ab4 Rent',msgPT:'Olá,\n\nMuito obrigado pela sua reserva — agora está totalmente confirmada! \n\nVeja abaixo os detalhes da sua reserva:\n\n⸻\n\n🚙 Empresa de aluguer: AB4RENT\n Contacto direto: +351 961 932 738\n Pagamento: Na entrega (dinheiro ou cartão – o que for mais conveniente)\n\n Entrega do carro no seu alojamento:\n– A empresa de aluguer de carros entregará o carro diretamente no seu alojamento.\n– Certifique-se de estar pronto na hora combinada, pois o representante irá encontrá-lo na entrada/recepção.\n– Normalmente, eles também entrarão em contacto consigo por telefone quando estiverem próximos.\n\n🪪 Documentos',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m18',nome:'Ab4 - Office',cat:'Rent-Car',empresa:'Ab4 Rent',subjectEN:'Your Car Rental Confirmation – Ab4 Rent',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nThank you so much for your booking — it’s now fully confirmed! \n\nPlease find below your reservation details:\n\n⸻\n\n🚙 Rental Company: AB4RENT\n Direct Contact: +351 961 932 738\n Payment: At pick-up (cash or card – whichever is most convenient)\n\n Pick-up Point (Office):\nGoogle Maps Location\n\nPlease go directly to the office at the scheduled time for car collection.\nA representative from AB4RENT will assist you there and complete the handover process quickly and smoothly.\n\n🪪 Documents required:\n– Passport or ID card\n– Driving licence\n(That’s all you’ll need!)\n\nAdditional important note',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
