  {id:'m20',nome:'Amsterdam - Aeroporto',cat:'Rent-Car',empresa:'Amsterdam Rent Car',subjectEN:'Your Car Rental Confirmation – Amsterdam Rent Car',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nThank you so much for your booking — it’s now fully confirmed!\n\nPlease find below your reservation details:\n\n⸻\n\n🚙 Rental Company: Amsterdam Rent Car\n Payment: At pick-up (cash or card – whichever is most convenient)\n\n Pick-up at Madeira Airport:\n– The company already has your flight number and will be waiting for you outside the arrivals area (on the street) at the scheduled time.\n– They’ll also be tracking your flight, so even if there are delays, you don’t need to worry — they’ll adjust accordingly.\n\n⚠️ Important:\nIf you don’t see anyone immediately after leaving the arrivals area,',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m21',nome:'Amsterdam - Hotel',cat:'Rent-Car',empresa:'Amsterdam Rent Car',subjectEN:'Your Car Rental Confirmation – Amsterdam Rent Car',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nThank you so much for your booking — it’s now fully confirmed! \n\nPlease find below your reservation details:\n\n⸻\n\n🚙 Rental Company: Amsterdam Rent Car\n Direct Contact: +351 968 566 790\n Payment: At delivery (cash or card – whichever is most convenient)\n\n Car Delivery at Your Accommodation:\nThe rent-a-car company will deliver the car directly to your accommodation at the agreed time.\nPlease make sure to be ready at that time, as the representative will meet you at the entrance or reception.\nThey usually contact you by phone once they are nearby to make the handover quick and smooth.\n',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m22',nome:'Amsterdam - Office',cat:'Rent-Car',empresa:'Amsterdam Rent Car',subjectEN:'Your Car Rental Confirmation – Amsterdam Rent Car',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nThank you so much for your booking — it’s now fully confirmed! \n\nPlease find below your reservation details:\n\n⸻\n\n🚙 Rental Company: Amsterdam Rent Car\n Direct Contact: +351 968 566 790\n Payment: At pick-up (cash or card – whichever is most convenient)\n\n Pick-up Point (Office):\nGoogle Maps Location\n\nPlease go directly to the office at the scheduled time for car collection.\nA representative from Amsterdam Rent Car will assist you there and complete the handover process quickly and smoothly.\n\n🪪 Documents required:\n– Passport or ID card\n– Driving licence\n(That’s all you’ll need!)\n\nAdd',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m23',nome:'Amsterdam - Depósito',cat:'Rent-Car',empresa:'Amsterdam Rent Car',subjectEN:'Payment Required – Amsterdam Rent Car',msgEN:'Because this rent-a-car has limited availability, they require a €130 deposit to secure the booking — but don’t worry, this amount is deducted from the total.\n\n👉 Total rental price: €465\n– Pay €130 now to secure the car (via PayPal, Revolut or bank transfer)\n– Pay the remaining €335 on the day you pick up the car (by cash or card)\n\nHere are the payment options:\n🔸 Revolut: @miltonjfq\n🔸 PayPal (email): miltonjfernandesquintal@gmail.com\n🔸 PayPal link: paypal.me/miltonquintal1\n🔸 Bank transfer (IBAN): PT50 0018 000365871568020 18 \n(If paying by bank transfer, please send proof of payment to info@be',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m24',nome:'Lido - Aeroporto',cat:'Rent-Car',empresa:'LidoTours Rent Car',subjectEN:'Your Car Rental Confirmation – Lido Tours',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nThank you so much for your booking — it’s now fully confirmed! \nBelow you’ll find all your reservation details:\n\n⸻\n\n🚙 Rental Company: Lido Tours\n\n Direct Contact: +351 916 609 726\n Payment: At pick-up (cash or card — whichever is easiest for you)\n\n⸻\n\n🛬 Pick-up at Madeira Airport\n\nHere’s how the airport pick-up works:\n        •        The company already has your flight number.\n        •        Once you land, a representative from Lido Tours will meet you outside the arrivals area, holding a sign with the Lido Tours logo (not Beyond Madeira).\n        •        It’s normal for the repr',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m25',nome:'Lido - Hotel',cat:'Rent-Car',empresa:'LidoTours Rent Car',subjectEN:'Your Car Rental Confirmation – Lido Tours',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nThank you so much for your booking — it’s now fully confirmed! \nBelow you’ll find all the details for your reservation:\n\n⸻\n\n🚙 Rental Company: Lido Tours\n\n Direct Contact: +351 916 609 726\n Payment: At pick-up (cash or card – whichever is most convenient)\n\n🏨 Pick-up at Your Accommodation\n\nA representative from Lido Tours will meet you directly at your accommodation at the scheduled time.\n\nThey will:\n– Call or message you shortly before arrival\n– Meet you outside your accommodation\n– Bring the contract and the car to you\n– Guide you through the quick pick-up process\n\nIf your street is',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m26',nome:'Lido - Office',cat:'Rent-Car',empresa:'LidoTours Rent Car',subjectEN:'Your Car Rental Confirmation – Lido Tours',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nThank you so much for your booking — it’s now fully confirmed! \n\nPlease find below your reservation details:\n\n⸻\n\n🚙 Rental Company: Lido Tours\n Direct Contact: +351 916 609 726\n Payment: At pick-up (cash or card – whichever is most convenient)\n\n Pick-up Location:\nYou can collect the car directly from their office:\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/qyymHgRNTQnC5vWY6\n\n– When you arrive, you’ll just need to present your ID/passport and driving licence.\n– A €50 fuel deposit is required (fully refunded when you return the car with the same fuel level).\n– The team at Lido Tours will prepare the con',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m27',nome:'Explorers - Geral',cat:'Hikes',empresa:'Madeira Explorers',subjectEN:'Madeira Hikes – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hi \n\nYour hike is confirmed — thank you so much for booking with Beyond Madeira! 🙏🌿\n\n🚶 The company running your hike is Madeira Explorers, and their contact number is +351 962 797 887.\nIf you need anything on the day, feel free to call or message them directly.\n\n€ Payment must be made in cash.\n Pick-up is scheduled for around 09:00 AM at your accommodation\n\n⸻\n\nJust a few quick reminders \n\n🧥 Please wear comfortable clothes and good walking shoes. A light jacket is also recommended — it can get chilly in the mountains.\n💧 Bring water and optionally a snack or light lunch — the hike usually inc',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m28',nome:'LidoTours - Tribunal Justiça',cat:'Hikes',empresa:'Lido Tours',subjectEN:'Madeira Hikes – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hi,\n\n Your hike is confirmed — thank you for booking with Beyond Madeira!\n\n🚶 The company running your hike is Lido Tours, and their contact number is +351 916 609 726.\nIf you need to get in touch with them on the day of the hike, feel free to call or message directly.\n\n€ Payment must be made in cash.\n Pick-up is scheduled for 09:00 AM at the meeting point.\n Meeting point: Tribunal da Justiça in Funchal\n👉 https://maps.app.goo.gl/WMQ4y7GYBHnRsikP9\n\n⸻\n\nJust a few quick reminders:\n\n🧥 Please wear comfortable clothes and good walking shoes. A light jacket is also recommended — it can get chilly in',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
