  {id:'m30',nome:'FreeSpirit - Geral',cat:'Hikes',empresa:'Free Spirit',subjectEN:'Madeira Hikes – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hi,\n\nYour hike is confirmed!\n🚶 The company running your activity is Madeira Free Spirit Walks.\nIf you need anything on the day, you can contact them directly:\n +351 927 390 020 (WhatsApp available for calls and messages without extra charges)\nYou can also message us if you prefer — we’re always happy to help!\n\n Pick-up will be at 08:40/08:45 AM at the bus stop in your hotel:\n€ Payment must be made in cash.\n\n⸻\n\nJust a few quick reminders:\n\n🧥 Please wear comfortable clothes and good walking shoes. A light jacket is also recommended — it can get chilly in the mountains.\n💧 Bring water and option',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m31',nome:'FreeSpirit - Caldeirão Verde',cat:'Hikes',empresa:'Free Spirit',subjectEN:'Caldeirão Verde Hike – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hi,\n\n\nYour Caldeirão Verde hike is confirmed!\n🚶 The company running your activity is Madeira Free Spirit Walks.\nIf you need anything on the day, you can contact them directly:\n +351 927 390 020 (WhatsApp available for calls and messages without extra charges)\nYou can also message us if you prefer — we’re always happy to help!\n\n Pick-up will be at 08:40/08:45 AM at the bus stop in your hotel:\n€ Payment must be made in cash.\n\n⸻\n\nJust a few quick reminders:\n\n🌿 €3 fee per person for official trails (Madeira government tax – not included).\n🧥 Comfortable clothes, good walking shoes, and a light ja',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m32',nome:'Wilder - Sunrise (pagamento)',cat:'Hikes',empresa:'Wilder Madeira',subjectEN:'Sunrise – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hi!\n\nThank you so much for booking with us! \nWe’re excited to have you join one of the most loved experiences in Madeira — you’re going to love it! 🌄\n\nYour Sunrise Tour will be operated by Wilder Madeira.\nIf you need anything, feel free to contact them directly:\n +351 911 993 345\nOf course, you can always reach out to us too — we’re here for anything you need!\n\n⏰ Pick-up Time:\nThe guide will message you the evening before the tour (usually around 9 PM) with your exact pick-up time after finalising the pick-up list.\nIf you haven’t received any update by then, feel free to message us and we’ll',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m33',nome:'Damwalk - Geral',cat:'Hikes',empresa:'DamWalk',subjectEN:'Private Hike – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hi! \n\nThanks so much for your booking — it’s all confirmed!\n\nYour guide will be Damião, and you’re in great hands. He’s an experienced local guide who knows Madeira like the back of his hand.\n\n If you need anything on the day, you can contact him directly at +351 915 667 020.\nHe’ll also message you the day before the walk to confirm the exact pick-up time and details.\n\n€ Payment must be made in cash.\n\n⸻\n\nJust a few quick reminders:\n🧥 Please wear comfortable clothes and proper walking shoes\n🌬️ Bring a light jacket, as it can get cooler in the mountains\n💧 Carry some water and light snacks\n☕ The',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m34',nome:'Damwalk - Sunrise',cat:'Hikes',empresa:'DamWalk',subjectEN:'Sunrise Tour – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hi! \n\nThanks so much for your booking — it’s all confirmed!\n\nYour guide will be Damião, and you’re in great hands. He’s a real expert and knows the island like the back of his hand.\n\n If you need anything on the day, you can contact him directly:\n+351 915 667 020\n\n🕘 Damião will send you the exact pick-up time the day before the tour, or even two days before.\nIf you haven’t received any update by the evening before the activity (around 9 PM), feel free to send him a message — or message us directly and we’ll help right away.\n\n🌄 This is one of the most loved experiences among our guests — we’r',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m35',nome:'AdventureKingdom - Geral',cat:'Hikes',empresa:'Madeira Adventure Kingdom',subjectEN:'Madeira Hikes – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hi,\nThank you again for your booking! \n\nThe company running your activity is Madeira Adventure Kingdom.\nThey’re a trusted local company with nearly 1,300 positive reviews, so we’re sure you’ll have a fantastic experience! \n\nIf you need anything on the day, you can contact them directly:\n +351 918 080 557 \n +351 918 080 160\n\nYou can also message us if you prefer — we’re always happy to help!\n Pick-up will be at 8:30 AM directly at your hotel — no need to go anywhere else.\n€ Payment must be made in cash.\n\n⸻\n\nJust a few quick reminders:\n\n🧥 Please wear comfortable clothes and good walking sho',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m36',nome:'AdventureKingdom - Stairway to Heaven',cat:'Hikes',empresa:'Madeira Adventure Kingdom',subjectEN:'Stairway to Heaven – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hi,\nThank you again for your booking! \n\nYour Stairway to Heaven hike is confirmed!\n\n Pick-up will be at 8:30 AM directly at your hotel — no need to go anywhere else.\n\nThe company running your activity is Madeira Adventure Kingdom.\nThey’re a trusted local company with nearly 1,300 positive reviews, so we’re sure you’ll have a fantastic experience! \n\nIf you need anything on the day, you can contact them directly:\n +351 918 080 557 \n +351 918 080 160\n\nYou can also message us if you prefer — we’re always happy to help!\n\n⸻\n\nA few quick reminders:\n\n🧥 Please wear comfortable clothes and bring a ',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m37',nome:'SeaBorn - Whales & Dolphins',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'SeaBorn',subjectEN:'Whales and Dolphins Tour – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nYour Dolphin & Whale Watching Tour is confirmed — thank you for booking with Beyond Madeira! \n\n🚤 The company running your tour is Seaborn Catamaran, and their direct contact number is +351 291 231 312.\nIf you need anything on the day of the activity, you can call or message them directly.\n\n Payment can be made on the day, directly at the kiosk — either by cash or card.\n Please make sure to arrive 30 minutes before departure for payment and check-in.\n Meeting point: Funchal Marina – look for the kiosk labeled “Seaborn Catamaran”.\n👉 Google Maps location: https://maps.app.goo.gl/ekqXk',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'Olá,\n\nA sua excursão para observação de golfinhos e baleias está confirmada — obrigado por reservar com a Beyond Madeira! \n\n🚤 A empresa responsável pela sua excursão é a Seaborn Catamaran, e o seu número de contacto direto é +351 291 231 312.\nSe precisar de alguma coisa no dia da atividade, pode ligar ou enviar uma mensagem diretamente para eles.\n\n O pagamento pode ser feito no dia, diretamente no quiosque — em dinheiro ou cartão.\n Certifique-se de chegar 30 minutos antes da partida para efetuar o pagamento e fazer o check-in.\n Ponto de encontro: Marina do Funchal — procure o quiosque com ',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m38',nome:'SeaBorn - Whales & Dolphins (com carro)',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'SeaBorn',subjectEN:'Whales and Dolphins Tour – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hi,\n\nThank you so much for your reservation — we’re happy to confirm everything for your Sunset Catamaran Tour with Seaborn! \nBelow you’ll find all the important info to help you prepare and enjoy the experience:\n\n⸻\n\n Meeting Point & Check-in\n        •        Location: Funchal Marina – look for the kiosk labeled “Seaborn Catamaran”\n        •        Check-in time: Please arrive 30 minutes before departure for check-in and payment.\n        •        ⏰ Example: If the tour starts at 6:00pm, please arrive by 5:30pm.\n\n🔗 Google Maps (Seaborn kiosk location):\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/ekqXkpoD42hLXMVd',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m39',nome:'SeaBorn - Sunset',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'SeaBorn',subjectEN:'Sunset Tour – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nYour Sunset Catamaran Tour is confirmed — thank you for booking with Beyond Madeira! 🌅\n\n🚤 The company running your tour is Seaborn Catamaran, and their direct contact number is +351 291 231 312.\nIf you need anything on the day of the activity, you can call or message them directly.\n\n€ Payment can be made on the day, directly at the kiosk (cash or card).\n Please arrive 30 minutes before departure (4:30 PM) for payment and check-in.\n Meeting point: Funchal Marina — look for the kiosk labeled “Seaborn Catamaran”.\n👉 Google Maps location: https://maps.app.goo.gl/ekqXkpoD42hLXMVd8\n\n⸻\n\nJust',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m40',nome:'VMT - Whales & Dolphins',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'VMT',subjectEN:'Whales and Dolphins Tour – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nYour Catamaran Tour is confirmed — thank you so much for booking with Beyond Madeira! 🌊🐬\nWe’re sure you’re going to love this experience.\n\n🚤 Tour Operator: VMT Madeira – Catamaran Trips\n Direct contact: +351 963 796 860\n(If you need anything on the day, you can contact them directly.)\n\n€ Payment: On the day, at the kiosk (cash or card accepted)\n Arrival time: Please arrive 30 minutes before departure for check-in and payment\n Meeting point: Funchal Marina — kiosk “VMT Madeira – Catamaran Trips”\n👉 Google Maps: https://maps.app.goo.gl/BhC82c6o2GiLFHTr7\n\n⸻\n\nImportant reminders & tips 🌊',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m41',nome:'VMT - Sunset',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'VMT',subjectEN:'Sunset Tour – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nYour Sunset Catamaran Tour with VMT Madeira – Catamaran Trips is confirmed — thank you for booking with Beyond Madeira! 🌅🌊\n\n🚤 The company running your trip is VMT Madeira – Catamaran Trips, and their direct contact number is +351 963 796 860.\nIf you need anything on the day of the activity, you can call or message them directly.\n\n€ Payment can be made on the day at the kiosk (cash or card).\n Please arrive 30 minutes before departure for check-in and payment.\n Meeting point: Funchal Marina — kiosk “VMT Madeira – Catamaran Trips”.\n👉 Google Maps location: https://maps.app.goo.gl/BhC82c6',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m42',nome:'VMT - Kayak',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'VMT',subjectEN:'Kayak Tour – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nYour Kayak Experience is confirmed — thank you for booking with Beyond Madeira! 🚣‍♂️🌊\n\n🚤 The company running your activity is VMT Madeira – Catamaran Trips, and their direct contact number is +351 963 796 860.\nIf you need anything on the day, you can call or message them directly.\n\n€ Payment can be made on the day at the kiosk (cash or card).\n Please arrive 30 minutes before departure for payment and check-in.\n Meeting point: Funchal Marina — kiosk “VMT Madeira – Catamaran Trips”.\n👉 Google Maps location: https://maps.app.goo.gl/BhC82c6o2GiLFHTr7\n\n⸻\n\nJust a few quick reminders:\n\n👕 Bri',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m43',nome:'VMT - Atlantic Festival',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'VMT',subjectEN:'Atlantic Festival Tour – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nYour Kayak Experience is confirmed — thank you for booking with Beyond Madeira! 🚣‍♂️🌊\n\n🚤 The company running your activity is VMT Madeira – Catamaran Trips, and their direct contact number is +351 963 796 860.\nIf you need anything on the day, you can call or message them directly.\n\n€ Payment can be made on the day at the kiosk (cash or card).\n Please arrive 30 minutes before departure for payment and check-in.\n Meeting point: Funchal Marina — kiosk “VMT Madeira – Catamaran Trips”.\n👉 Google Maps location: https://maps.app.goo.gl/BhC82c6o2GiLFHTr7\n\n⸻\n\nJust a few quick reminders:\n\n👕 Bri',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m44',nome:'VMT - Reveillon',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'VMT',subjectEN:'Reveillon Tour – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nYour New Year’s Eve Boat Tour is confirmed — thank you for booking with Beyond Madeira! 🎆⛵\n\n🚤 The company running your trip is VMT Madeira – Catamaran Trips, and their direct contact number is +351 963 796 860.\nIf you need anything on the day of the activity, you can call or message them directly.\n\n€ Payment can be made on the day at the kiosk (cash or card).\n Please arrive 30 minutes before departure for check-in and payment.\n Meeting point: Funchal Marina — please look for the kiosk with your boat operator’s name.\n\n⸻\n\nJust a few quick reminders:\n\n🎇 Duration: 31st December – 11:00 P',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m45',nome:'NauSantaMaria - Whales & Dolphins',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'Nau Santa Maria',subjectEN:'Whales and Dolphins Tour – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hi,\n\nThank you for your booking — it’s confirmed! \n\n🚢 Important info for your boat trip with Nau Santa Maria:\n\nPlease make sure to check in 30 minutes before departure at the Nau Santa Maria kiosk in Funchal Marina.\nJust give your name or show your ticket — your reservation is already confirmed.\n\n Location: https://maps.app.goo.gl/cjgDUJTgYM6nD3wT9\n Direct contact: +351 965 010 180\n\n€ Payment must be made in cash at the kiosk on the day of the tour.\n\n⸻\n\nWe recommend bringing:\n🧥 A warm jacket or extra layers — it can get chilly out at sea\n🧴 Sunscreen\n🩱 A towel and swimsuit if you’d like to sw',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m46',nome:'VipDolphins - Whales & Dolphins',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'VipDolphins',subjectEN:'VIP Dolphins Tour – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nThank you for booking with us!\n\n🐬 The company running your boat tour is VipDolphins, and their contact number is +351 924 438 001.\nIf you need to get in touch with them on the day of the tour, feel free to call or message them directly.\n\n Please make sure to arrive 30 minutes before departure at the VipDolphins kiosk in Funchal Marina.\n\n Google Maps location:\n👉 https://maps.app.goo.gl/zTmrfBhgBLRu8zEf6\n\n⸻\n\nJust a few quick reminders:\n\n✨ What’s included in your experience:\n– Open bar (cocktails, sparkling wine, Madeira wine, beer, soft drinks, coffee)\n– Delicious local snacks\n– Free W',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m47',nome:'VipDolphins - Sunset (com parking)',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'VipDolphins',subjectEN:'Sunset Tour – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nThank you again for booking with us — we’re excited for you to experience this unforgettable Sunset Boat Tour with VipDolphins! 🐬✨\n\n🚢 The company running your tour is VipDolphins, and their direct contact number is +351 924 438 001.\n\n Departure is at 6:30 PM — please arrive 30 minutes before (by 6:00 PM) at the VipDolphins kiosk in Funchal Marina.\n\n Location: Funchal Marina – VipDolphins kiosk\n\n⸻\n\n Parking Recommendation\nIf you’re coming by car, we suggest Parque Almirante Reis, just a short walk from the marina.\nGoogle Maps: Parque Almirante Reis\nApprox. cost: €1.50–€1.60 per hour.',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m48',nome:'VipDolphins - Whales & Dolphins (pagamento)',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'VipDolphins',subjectEN:'Confirmation & Payment Details – VipDolphins Boat Tour',msgEN:'Hi,\n\nThank you so much for booking your boat tour with us! \nWe’re happy to confirm your experience with our trusted partner VipDolphins — a premium dolphin & whale watching tour with limited seats on board for a more exclusive and relaxed experience.\n\nDue to the limited capacity of the boat, advance payment is required to secure your spot.\n\n⸻\n\n🐬 Tour Operator: VipDolphins\n Contact Number: +351 924 438 001\n(You can call or WhatsApp them directly on the day if needed.)\n\n Meeting Time: Please arrive 30 minutes before departure\n Meeting Point: VipDolphins Kiosk at Funchal Marina\n👉 Google Maps ',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m49',nome:'Bonita - Whales & Dolphins',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'Bonita da Madeira',subjectEN:'Whales and Dolphins Tour – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nThank you for booking with us!\n\n🚢 The company running your boat trip is Bonita da Madeira, and their contact number is +351 918 118 771.\nIf you need to get in touch with them on the day of the tour, feel free to call or message them directly.\n\n€ Payment must be made in cash.\n Please make sure to arrive 30 minutes before departure at the Bonita da Madeira kiosk in Funchal Marina (Marina Nova do Funchal, Cais nº8).\n\n⸻\n\nJust a few quick reminders:\n\n🧥 Bring a light jacket — it can get breezy out at sea.\n🧴 Sunscreen is highly recommended.\n🩱 Swimsuit & towel if you’d like to swim.\n💧 A bottl',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m50',nome:'Bonita - Reveillon',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'Bonita da Madeira',subjectEN:'Reveillon Tour – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nThank you for booking with us!\n\n🚢 The company running your New Year’s Eve boat trip is Bonita da Madeira, and their contact number is +351 918 118 771.\nIf you need to get in touch with them before the day of the event, please call or message them directly.\n\n€ Payment must be made in cash.\n Boarding is at 10:30 PM at Marina Nova do Funchal, Pier 8 (next to the Atlantic Pearl kiosk – landmark: Café O Verdinho). The trip runs until 1:00 AM.\nPlease make sure to arrive 20–30 minutes in advance.\n\n⸻\n\nJust a few quick reminders:\n\n🥂 Includes a welcome drink (glass of sparkling wine) per person',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m51',nome:'Bonita - Desertas Island',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'Bonita da Madeira',subjectEN:'Desertas Island – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nYour Desertas Island Boat Tour is confirmed — thank you for booking with Beyond Madeira! 🌊🐬\n\n🚢 The company running your trip is Bonita da Madeira, and their direct contact number is +351 918 118 771.\nIf you need anything on the day of the activity, you can call or message them directly.\n\n€ Payment must be made in cash.\n Please arrive 30 minutes before departure at the Bonita da Madeira kiosk in Marina Nova do Funchal, Cais nº8. Boarding is at 09:30 AM and the trip runs from 10:00 AM to 18:30 PM.\n\n⸻\n\nJust a few quick reminders:\n\n🥂 Includes a welcome drink (glass of Madeira wine).\n🍽️ Ho',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m52',nome:'SeaMotions - Whales & Dolphins',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'SeaMotions',subjectEN:'Whales and Dolphins Tour – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nYour Whale & Dolphin Watching Tour is confirmed — thank you for booking with Beyond Madeira! 🌊🐬\n\n🚤 The company running your trip is SeaMotions, and their direct contact number is +351 910 308 804.\nIf you need anything on the day of the activity, you can call or message them directly.\n\n€ Payment must be made in cash.\n Please arrive 30 minutes before departure for payment and check-in.\n Meeting point: Quinta do Lorde Marina or Casa do Sardinha (Tour Spot Café), depending on your route. The company will confirm this detail.\n\n⸻\n\nJust a few quick reminders:\n\n🧥 Bring a light jacket or wind',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m53',nome:'SeaMotions - Transfer Sardinha→Lorde',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'SeaMotions',subjectEN:'Boat Transfer – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hello,\n\n🌊 SeaMotions Boat Trip Confirmation\n\nThank you for booking your boat trip with SeaMotions!\n\n🛥️ Your Trip\n• Route: Cais da Sardinha ➡️ Quinta do Lorde\n• Departure Time: Around 2:30 PM\n\n Location & Contact\nSeaMotions operates from Quinta do Lorde Marina and also at Casa do Sardinha (Tour Spot Café).\n Direct contact: +351 910 308 804\n\n€ Payment\nPayment must be made in cash at the restaurant at the end of the hike.\n👉 Please mention that the reservation was made through Beyond Madeira when paying.\n\n⸻\n\nA few recommendations:\n✔️ Bring sunscreen 🧴\n✔️ Swimsuit & towel if you’d like to swim ',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m54',nome:'OnTales - Private Charter',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'On Tales',subjectEN:'Private Charter– Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nYour private boat tour is confirmed.\n\n🚤 The company operating your tour is On Tales, and their direct contact number is +351 911 911 777.\nThey should also contact you directly closer to the time.\n\n Meeting Point\nOn Tales location – Marina da Calheta\nPlease arrive at least 15–20 minutes before departure for check-in.\n\n⸻\n\n🧥 What to bring:\n– Swimsuit 🩱\n– Towel 🧺\n– Sunscreen 🌞\n– Water to stay hydrated 💧\n– Optional snacks 🍿\n\n⸻\n\nIf you have any questions before your tour, feel free to message us anytime — we’re always here to help 🙌\n\nWarm regards,',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m55',nome:'RotaCetáceos - Whales & Dolphins',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'Rota dos Cetáceos',subjectEN:'Whales and Dolphins Tour – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nThank you for booking with us — your Dolphin & Whale Watching Tour with Rota dos Cetáceos is confirmed! 🐬🐳\n\n Meeting Point & Check-in\nRota dos Cetáceos office – Galerias São Lourenço, Loja 35, Funchal, 9000-045\nPlease arrive 30 minutes before departure for check-in and payment.\n\n Direct contact: +351 918 828 242\n Email: rotacetaceos@gmail.com\n\n Payment:\nNo need to pay in advance — you can pay on the day, by cash or card.\n\n⸻\n\n🧥 What to bring:\n– Comfortable clothes and a light jacket (it can get breezy at sea)\n– Sunscreen 🧴\n– Swimsuit & towel 🩱🧺 if you’d like to swim (possible depend',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m56',nome:'AzulDiving - Try Scuba Diving',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'Azul Diving',subjectEN:'Scuba Diving Tour – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hi,\n\nThank you so much for booking your Try Scuba Diving Experience with us — it’s confirmed! 🌊🐠\n\n⸻\n\n Meeting Point\nAzul Diving Madeira \nRua Carvalho Araújo, 9000-022 Funchal, Madeira, Portugal\n👉 Google Maps: https://maps.app.goo.gl/nYaV8phtLxHvaSYc6\n\n➡️ Please arrive at least 15 minutes early for check-in and preparation.\n\n🤿 Operator: Azul Diving Madeira (also known as Blue Safari Madeira)\n +351 914 526 675\n info@azuldiving.com\n\n⸻\n\n✔️ What to Bring:\n🩱 Swimsuit\n🧴 Sunscreen\n📱 Mobile phone\n🧺 Towel\n💧 Water & light snacks (optional)\n\n How to Get There:\nAzul Diving Madeira is located directly a',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m57',nome:'SeaLaVie - Private Charter',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'Sea La Vie',subjectEN:'Private Charter– Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nYour Sea La Vie – Private Boat Charter is confirmed — thank you for booking with Beyond Madeira! 🚤🌊\n\n🚤 The company running your trip is Sea La Vie, and their direct contact number is +351 965 710 036.\nIf you need anything on the day of the activity, you can call or message them directly.\n\n Please arrive 15 minutes before departure at the marina to ensure a smooth check-in.\n Meeting point: Cais 8 – Funchal Marina (Zona Comercial)\n\n⸻\n\nJust a few quick reminders:\n\n🧴 Sunscreen is essential.\n🩱 Bring your swimsuit and a towel if you’d like to swim.\n👒 A hat or cap is recommended for sun pro',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m58',nome:'SurfClub - Surf Lessons',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'Surf Club Madeira',subjectEN:'Surf Lessons - Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hi,\n\nThank you for booking with Beyond Madeira!\nYour Surf Lesson is now confirmed:\n\n️ [insert date here]\n🕒 [insert chosen time slot]\n\n Meeting Point: Praia da Alagoa, Porto da Cruz\n👉 Google Maps: https://maps.app.goo.gl/XaVpG1x74oSuGd7o9\n\n Provider: Surf Club Madeira— +351 963 356 674\n\n💰 Payment:\nCash, Revolut, PayPal or Bitcoin (BTC) — just pay on the day.\n\n⸻\n\n🍹 What to Bring:\n\n– Sunscreen\n– Water and Sancks\n– Swimwear + towel (if you’d like to swim)\n\n⸻\n\nIf you have any questions or want to adjust anything, just let us know — we’re always here to help \n\nEnjoy your experience — it’s going ',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m59',nome:'FishingFamily - Fishing Tour (450€)',cat:'Water Experiences',empresa:'Fishing Family',subjectEN:'Fishing Tour - Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hello,\n\nThank you very much for your booking request – your fishing trip with Fishing Family is pre-reserved and just needs the deposit to be fully confirmed. 🎣\n\nHere are all the details:\n\n⸻\n\n Date & Time\n\n4-hour Fishing Trip – 8:00 AM departure\n\n⛵ Operator\n\nFishing Family – coastal & offshore fishing around Madeira Island and Desertas.\n\n Meeting point: Funchal Marina – “Fishing Family” boat\n Google Maps: https://maps.app.goo.gl/jehQeB3hHY8XJiYdA\n Contact on the day: +351 966 377 701\n\nPlease arrive 20–30 minutes before departure for check-in.\n\n⸻\n\nWhat’s included\n        •        Rods, re',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m60',nome:'BeLocal - Canyoning (pick-up hotel)',cat:'Adventure',empresa:'Be Local',subjectEN:'Canyoning Experience – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hi,\n\nThank you so much for booking your activity with Beyond Madeira! \nWe’re happy to confirm your Canyoning experience with our trusted partner Be Local Madeira — a company with over 4,400 five-star reviews, so you’re truly in great hands. You’re going to love it!\n\nHere are all your final details:\n\n⸻\n\n🚌 Pick-up:\nYour pick-up will be at 08:15/8:20 directly at your hotel.\n\n Partner Contact: +351 935 124 260\n€ Payment: Cash only on the day (no card / PayPal / Revolut with this partner)\n\n⸻\n\nIncluded:\n– Full canyoning equipment\n– Friendly, certified guides\n– Return to your car/accommodation af',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m61',nome:'BeLocal - Coasteering (pick-up hotel)',cat:'Adventure',empresa:'Be Local',subjectEN:'Coasteering Experience – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hi,\n\nThank you for booking your activity with us at Beyond Madeira! \nWe’re happy to confirm your Coasteering experience with our trusted partner Be Local Madeira.\n\nPlease find all the final details below:\n\n⸻\n\n🕘 Pick-up Time: Around 09:15 AM directly from your hotel\n🚐 The team from Be Local Madeira will pick you up at the entrance/reception and take you to the starting point of the activity.\nAfter the experience, you’ll be comfortably driven back to your hotel.\n\n Partner Contact: +351 935 124 260\n€ Payment: Must be made in cash only on the day of the activity (no card/PayPal/Revolut for this ',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m62',nome:'BeLocal - Canyoning Intermediate (pick-up hotel)',cat:'Adventure',empresa:'Be Local',subjectEN:'Canyoning Experience – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hi,\n\nThank you so much for booking your activity with Beyond Madeira! \nWe’re happy to confirm your Level 2 Canyoning experience with our trusted partner Be Local Madeira — a company with over 4,400 five-star reviews, so you’re truly in great hands. You’re going to love it!\n\nHere are all your final details:\n\n⸻\n\n🚌 Pick-up:\nYour pick-up will be at 08:15 directly at your  accomodation\n\n Partner Contact: +351 935 124 260\n€ Payment: Cash only on the day (no card / PayPal / Revolut with this partner)\n\n⸻\n\nIncluded:\n– Full canyoning equipment\n– Friendly, certified guides\n– Return to your car/accomm',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m63',nome:'BeLocal - Canyoning (meeting point)',cat:'Adventure',empresa:'Be Local',subjectEN:'Canyoning Experience – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hi,\n\nThank you for booking your activity with us at Beyond Madeira! \nWe’re happy to confirm your Canyoning experience with our trusted partner Be Local Madeira.\n\nPlease find all the final details below:\n\n⸻\n\n🅿️ Parking is free and easily accessible — it’s located right where we’ll start the experience.\nAfterwards, we’ll bring you back to your car, safe and sound.\n\n Meeting Point: Curral das Freiras – Capela São Rafael\n🕘 Meeting Time: 09:15 AM\n https://maps.app.goo.gl/9M2rdhieTADBbJWr7 \n Directions Tip:\nThis is a stunning viewpoint just 20 minutes from Funchal.\nAfter you exit the tunnel, tur',subjectPT:'Experiência de Canyoning – Confirmação e Detalhes Finais',msgPT:'Olá,\n\nObrigado por reservar a sua atividade connosco na Beyond Madeira! \nTemos o prazer de confirmar a sua experiência de Canyoning com o nosso parceiro de confiança Be Local Madeira.\n\nEncontre todos os detalhes finais abaixo:\n\n⸻\n\n🅿️ O estacionamento é gratuito e de fácil acesso — está localizado exatamente onde começaremos a experiência.\nDepois, levaremos você de volta ao seu carro, são e salvo.\n\n Ponto de encontro: Curral das Freiras – Capela São Rafael\n🕘 Hora do encontro: 09:15\n https://maps.app.goo.gl/9M2rdhieTADBbJWr7 \n Dica de direção:\nEste é um miradouro deslumbrante a apenas 20 min',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m64',nome:'Epic - Canyoning Beginner (pick-up hotel)',cat:'Adventure',empresa:'Epic Madeira',subjectEN:'Canyoning Beginner Tour – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hi,\n\nYour Canyoning Beginner Tour is confirmed with our partner Epic Madeira! \n\n Pick-up Point: At your hotel (the team will meet you directly at the reception)\n Pick-up Time: Around 9:00 AM\n\n Contact (Epic Madeira): +351 913 988 682\nFeel free to message them directly if needed — or contact us anytime!\n\n€ Payment: Cash, Revolut, PayPal, or Bitcoin (BTC)\n\n⸻\n\n🏞️ A few notes before your adventure\n\nIncluded:\n– All canyoning gear\n– Energy bar & bottle of water\n\n🎒 What to bring:\n– Swimsuit\n– Towel\n– Warm & comfortable clothes for after the activity (it’s in the mountains)\n– Sunscreen\n– Optiona',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m65',nome:'Epic - Canyoning Beginner (pick-up CR7)',cat:'Adventure',empresa:'Epic Madeira',subjectEN:'Canyoning Beginner Tour – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hi,\n\nYour Canyoning Beginner Tour is confirmed with our partner Epic Madeira! \n\n Pick-up Point: In front of the CR7 Museum, at the bus stop\n Location: https://maps.app.goo.gl/ct6cZRT2YMGJu42w5\n\n🕤 Pick-up Time: 09:30 AM\n\n Contact (Epic Madeira): +351 913 988 682\nFeel free to message them directly if needed — or contact us anytime!\n\n€ Payment: Cash, Revolut, PayPal, or Bitcoin (BTC)\n\n⸻\n\n🏞️ A few notes before your adventure\n\nIncluded:\n– All canyoning gear\n– Energy bar & bottle of water\n\n🎒 What to bring:\n– Swimsuit\n– Towel\n– Warm & comfortable clothes for after the activity (it’s in the moun',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
