  {id:'m70',nome:'Trail4Fun - Buggy 9:30 (pick-up hotel)',cat:'Adventure',empresa:'Trail4Fun',subjectEN:'Buggy Tour – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hi,\n\nThank you for booking your adventure with Beyond Madeira! \n\nYour Buggy Experience is confirmed with our partner Trail4Fun.\n\n🕤 Pick-up: The team will meet you directly at your hotel at 09:30 AM\n Contact (Trail4Fun): +351 913 211 323\nYou can contact the team directly if needed — or reach out to us anytime!\n\n€ Payment: At pick-up (cash or card)\n\n⸻\n\nIncluded:\n– All protective gear: helmet, gloves, etc.\n\n🎒 What to bring:\n– Comfortable, practical clothing\n– A light jacket (it can get chilly, especially in the mountains)\n– Snacks and water to stay hydrated during your adventure\n\n⸻\n\nThis fun ',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
