  {id:'m72',nome:'EBike - Beginner',cat:'Adventure',empresa:'E-Bike Madeira',subjectEN:'E-Bike Experience – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hi,\n\nYour reservation with E-Bike Madeira is confirmed! 🚴‍♀️🚴‍♂️\n\n\n\n Meeting Point:\n\nEstrada Monumental 182, Loja 2, 9000-098 Funchal\n\n Google Maps Location\n\n\n\n⏰ Start Time: 09:00\n\n Contact (E-Bike Madeira): +351 926 672 808\n\n\n\n👉 What to bring:\n\n– Comfortable clothes\n\n– Light jacket\n\n– Sunscreen\n\n– Good shoes\n\n– Snacks & water\n\n\n\nEnjoy your ride! If you need anything at all, just let us know — we’re always happy to help 💚\n\n\n\nWarm regards,',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
  {id:'m73',nome:'FlyMadeira - Paragliding',cat:'Adventure',empresa:'Fly on Madeira',subjectEN:'Paragliding Experience – Confirmation & Final Details',msgEN:'Hi\n\n\n\nThank you for booking your paragliding flight with Fly Madeira — here’s everything you need to know for your unforgettable experience!\n\n\n\n🪂 Paragliding Flight Details\n\n\n Meeting Point:\n\nGoogle Maps – click here\n\n🕚 Time: Please arrive by 11:00 AM (15 minutes before your scheduled flight)\n\n\n\n Operator: Fly Madeira\n\nContact: +351 966 712 882\n\n\n\n💸 Price:\n\nTotal: €150 per person\n\nYou’ve already paid €20\n\n💰 Remaining to pay on the day: €130 (in cash, Revolut, or PayPal)\n\n\n\nIf you weigh more than 100 kg, there is an additional fee of €30.\n\n\n\n⏱️ Duration:\n\n\nThe flight lasts approximately 15',subjectPT:'',msgPT:'',msgFR:''},
